WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.110
Squad 7!

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:05.500
We're going to save Alicia!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.590
Let's go!

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.750
Follow me!

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.620
Wait for us,

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.600
Alicia!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:31.120
Final Episode

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:31.120
Final Battle

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.720
Everyone!

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.150
Alicia's attack created a hole over there!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.200
We'll charge in through there!

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:34.910
Understood!

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.590
All right, let's go!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.060
Listen everyone.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.800
I'm going in first.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.910
Cover me from behind.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.390
Sorry, no can do.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.280
We'll lure out the enemies.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:05.350
Take that chance to rescue Alicia, Commander.

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.300
But if you guys do that...

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.860
Why are you acting reserved?

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:11.730
We're comrades, right?

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:14.440
That's right. This is for the sake of rescuing Alicia.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:20.410
Okay, let's go!

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.740
The intruders are near the fourth gun platform!

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.730
Shoot on sight!

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:25.460
Yes, sir!

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.320
All right.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.750
Rough things up and attract their attention!

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:34.130
Understood!

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.130
Okay...

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.210
Homer!

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:46.060
Behind! Behind you!

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.650
Thanks, Edy.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.060
Homer Peron.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:00.120
You owe me a big one.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.860
Man, there's no end to 'em.

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:09.880
Seriously!

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.090
Marina! Is it ready yet?

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.100
All right, let's get out of here!

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:17.090
They're escaping! After them!

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:24.970
Marina, you're quite pro.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:27.810
Leave the traps to me.

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:33.900
Everyone...

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.230
Thanks!

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.070
They're here too!

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:47.290
Surrender now!

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:48.830
Obediently come out and-

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.290
Faldio!

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:56.810
Don't be reckless!

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:57.670
Reckless?

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.360
What do you call what you're doing then?

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.700
You're the commander of Squad 7,

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.140
a man who can make the most reckless things go well!

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:09.340
That means that, as long as I'm beside you,

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.850
nothing is reckless.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.590
Yeah.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:14.820
You're right!

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.940
There was an explosion in Block E. Confirming the amount of damage.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.540
What's taking so long? Hurry and take care of it!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:29.160
Yes sir!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:36.500
Zaka!

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.570
Susie!

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:46.760
Damn!

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.470
Alicia...

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.550
Where are you, Alicia?!

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:51.310
Found 'em!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.230
Welkin.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.720
Alicia doesn't seem to be here.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:03:59.360
What should we do?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.110
Let's look deeper inside.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.170
Your Highness.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.280
I've brought the enemy Valkyria.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.120
What business do you have with me{at this point of time}?

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.400
You! You dare to talk to His Highness-

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.360
It's fine.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.210
You're dismissed.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:16.960
Yes, sir.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.010
Looks like your tongue has recovered faster than the rest of your body.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:28.000
I don't know why you captured me,

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.700
but I won't be manipulated by someone like you!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.620
What are you saying?

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.900
I saved you.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.520
You saved me?

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.400
That's right.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.380
As long as you obey me,

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:45.110
you'll obtain everything in the world.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.880
Don't you have anyone you call a companion?

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:50.490
Are there only two types of people in your eyes?

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.840
Those who obey and those who don't?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.460
Is there anything else?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.400
Unbelievable...

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.610
Then for whose sake did she...

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.670
Who do you mean by "she"?

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.950
Selvaria Bles...

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:10.100
When she thought she didn't have the right to follow you any longer,

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.680
she could only choose death.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.640
Nonsense.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.860
You were the one who defeated her,

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:18.900
and drove her to her death.

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:20.870
Right now,

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.940
you're the only Valkyria left.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.280
Shut up...

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.580
No need to be humble.

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.660
Be proud of your power.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.110
Shut up!

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:33.890
I don't want the power of the Valkyrur.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.590
I just want to be Alicia Melchiott, a normal person.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.550
Normal?

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:40.500
They're everywhere.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:43.420
Normal people have no value.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.380
Aren't you talking about yourself?

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:54.120
You're afraid of your own lack of value, aren't you?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.180
That's why you treat Selvaria,

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:59.190
and everyone else, like trash.

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:04.110
You poor thing.

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.550
Poor thing?

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.070
Are you pitying me?

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.620
If so, then let me tell you.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.460
All right, let's go.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.050
Okay.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.800
You saved me, Faldio.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.010
Are you okay?

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.080
Yeah.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:35.930
It's nothing.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.390
Let me have a look.

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:38.530
You have to treat it immediately.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.650
Over there!

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.350
I heard gunshots from there!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.440
Looks like there's no time for rest.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.360
I'll hold them back here.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:48.820
You go on ahead.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.640
What're you saying?!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.120
I can't do that!

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:55.930
Why are your companions acting as bait?

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.270
For the sake of saving Alicia, right?

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.810
It's my turn now.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:00.750
There they are!

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:04.220
Welkin!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.380
I'll go after I deal with them.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.580
Take care of Alicia.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.720
Yeah, got it!

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.460
You guys go around.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.050
We'll flank them!

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:23.900
Yes, sir!

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.410
Good grief.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:33.410
I'm too concerned with saving face...

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.500
Welkin,

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:47.250
make sure you save Alicia.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:15.870
Alicia!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.080
Welkin!

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:19.290
I'm coming to save you!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.700
Don't come!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:25.960
Welkin!

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.270
Maximilian!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.940
What on earth is that?

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.900
A man-made Valkyria system.

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.820
The unlimited Ragnite energy...

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:55.780
of the holy spear is all inside this.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.880
It's the strongest weapon.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.230
You should have seen it.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.790
The destructive power...

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:03.750
of the holy spear.

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:05.750
Right now,

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:09.280
I have that power.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.590
How ridiculous.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.300
Without relying on status in the Empire,

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.380
without relying on the power of the Valkyrur,

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.760
I can still become the ruler of this land!

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:36.460
Let us have a match, shall we? Your power versus mine.

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.490
Alicia, run!

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.330
Stop it!

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:47.750
Don't move!

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:52.740
Do you think you can defeat me with that?

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:58.930
Useless.

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:03.350
Welkin!

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:09.890
Looks like your power has recovered.

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:12.980
However, without the spear and shield,

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:18.450
how long can you withstand the attack from this man-made Valkyria system?

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.620
Why? Why did you come?

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.190
I'm not the only one.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:24.870
Everyone came to save you.

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.960
Such recklessness...

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.970
Alicia.

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:32.880
Let's go back together! To Bruhl!

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:39.720
Don't worry. If Maximilian's source of power is the holy spear,

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.430
there must be an energy transfer mechanism.{referring to the energy}

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:43.300
As long as we destroy that...

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:48.170
The time for reunions is over.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:50.060
Come! Fight me!

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:54.070
I'll definitely stop him.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:54.800
So...

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:55.530
Alicia!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:57.560
I'm here!

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:00.490
Your aim is to fight me, isn't it?

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.620
You're willing to fight at last.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:07.200
Let me enjoy it then.

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:16.980
There should be a transfer mechanism somewhere on his body.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.010
As long as I find that...

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.180
As expected of a Valkyria.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.280
But how about this?

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:26.760
Crap!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.070
Welkin! Are you okay?

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.860
What power...

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.220
Splendid.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.330
Splendid!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.600
Did you see that power?

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:48.840
This is akin to...

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:52.960
having the same power as a real Valkyria!

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:53.950
Now then.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.090
Game over.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.840
Die.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:03.970
What?

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:06.060
What happened?

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:08.270
Perhaps...

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:10.930
the energy of the holy spear is too much

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:13.720
for that thing to handle?

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:17.150
If we overload it with more energy...

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:20.220
Leave that to me!

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.150
Alicia, what're you doing?!

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.780
I need to find an opening!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.020
You still have that much power left?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.000
But it's useless.

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.730
This is the end.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.800
Stop!

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.090
You bastard...

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.430
How dare you strike at my weapon!

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:53.020
I suppose I'll send you to hell first after all!

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.480
Welkin!

00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.070
Die.

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:01.860
What are you trying to do?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.760
I won't let you do what you want!

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:06.340
I...

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.780
I'll protect...

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.240
the people I love!

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.960
Th-This is...

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.710
Wh-What is this!?

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.220
Alicia!

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.200
Alicia!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.470
That's enough! Let go!

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:36.230
You...

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:47.590
Surrender!

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:48.410
Maximilian!

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:54.120
To think that my ambitions would end here...

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.620
What're you trying to do?

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:01.170
Stop!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:09.360
I refuse to suffer the insult of being captured.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:13.560
However, you will be buried along with the Marmota!

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:32.910
Alicia!

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.080
I'll be there right away!

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.290
Don't come!

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.060
I know...

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:47.010
I know what's happening to me right now.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:48.980
This is...

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:49.970
the same as her...

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.560
Without a doubt,

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.970
I'll be consumed by my power and die!

00:14:58.920 --> 00:14:59.990
At this rate,

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:02.650
you and everyone else will be caught up in the explosion!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.900
Escape before my power overflows!

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:09.590
It's okay! I'll think of a way, so...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.000
Please, Welkin!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:15.450
I want you to protect everyone like how a commander should!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.170
I don't want you to...

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:19.300
die because of someone like me.

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:20.750
So please run!

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.590
Please!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:33.930
Welkin!

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:35.850
Why?

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.060
How can I abandon you?

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.970
Don't come, Welkin!

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.580
You'll die because of me!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.320
Just like the Darcsen Calamity...

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.530
Don't worry, I'm right beside you!

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:53.000
Let go, Welkin!

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.870
If this goes on, you'll...

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:57.790
I won't leave you again!

00:15:58.400 --> 00:15:59.800
Alicia,

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.750
I'll always be with you!

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:10.130
This is my...

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:13.190
You told me before.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:16.510
That this scarf is proof that you're a baker.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:21.060
That you always wore this so that you won't forget that.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.730
In my eyes,

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:25.560
you were sparkling and shining then.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.520
You were so beautiful.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:30.030
But...

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.530
we can't return to that time anymore.

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:33.570
I...

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:36.270
It doesn't matter whether you're a Valkyria or not.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:38.740
You're you, right?

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:44.210
Cheerful and kind, someone who dreams of being a baker....

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:47.540
I like that part of you, Alicia.

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:51.030
Welkin...

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:31.590
This scarf really does suit you best.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.050
Welkin...

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:42.780
Now, let's head back,

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:43.220
Alicia!

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:54.980
Commander...

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:57.610
Were they killed?

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.490
That's impossible!

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.550
How could they die?

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:02.890
How could they...

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.270
Wait.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.500
Everyone, look!

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:14.910
Commander!

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:16.130
Alicia!

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:22.630
After the battle,

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:25.980
the Empire called for a truce{cease fire} with Gallia. {This seems redundant}

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:30.030
Gallia and the Empire signed a truce,

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:34.580
ending the long, seven months battle.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:42.680
<i>Hide your scars with a smile.</i>

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:48.720
<i>All I need is you by my side.</i>

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:55.210
<i>I hope that, one day, things will end how I wish.</i>

00:18:55.210 --> 00:19:01.420
<i>It's kind of strange.</i>

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:07.830
<i>The sun rises quietly, tears dry off slowly</i>

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:14.020
<i>The winds behind blow toward the future.</i>

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:20.950
<i>The sun shines, my heart sings.</i>

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:27.140
<i>We've returned to peaceful mornings.</i>

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:33.780
<i>Holding hands with you, our hearts beat in sync.</i>

